{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08063","headline":"幽州胡马客歌 · 李白","name":"幽州胡马客歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽州胡马客，绿眼虎皮冠。\n笑拂两只箭，万人不可干。\n弯弓若转月，白雁落云端。\n双双掉鞭行，游猎向楼兰。\n出门不顾後，报国死何难。\n天骄五单于，狼戾好凶残。\n牛马散北海，割鲜若虎餐。\n虽居燕支山，不道朔雪寒。\n妇女马上笑，颜如赬玉盘。\n飜飞射鸟兽，花月醉雕鞍。\n旄头四光芒，争战若蜂攒。\n白刃洒赤血，流沙爲之丹。\n名将古谁是，疲兵良可叹。\n何时天狼灭，父子得闲安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}